              },
              {
                "text": "Thank you for contacting us about the torn bag in your recent order.",
                "citations": [],
                "supported": true,
                "problem": null
              },
              {
                "text": "We see that order BB-1040 was delivered on 2026-10-04.",
                "citations": [
                  "order:BB-1040"
                ],
                "supported": true,
                "problem": null
              },
              {
                "text": "To process a free replacement for the damaged bag, please send us a photo of the torn bag and the outer box within 14 days of delivery.",
                "citations": [
                  "passage:damaged.torn-bags"
                ],
                "supported": true,
                "problem": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Once we receive the photo, we will arrange to send you a replacement at no cost and you do not need to return the damaged bag.",
                "citations": [
                  "passage:damaged.torn-bags"
                ],
                "supported": true,
                "problem": null
              },
              {
                "text": "We look forward to resolving this quickly for you.",
                "citations": [],
                "supported": true,
                "problem": null
              },
              {
                "text": "Best regards, Basalt & Bean support",
                "citations": [],
                "supported": true,
                "problem": null
